DEEMO 1 artwork archive
Maintained by FridrichMethod (Zhaoyang Li)
https://github.com/FridrichMethod/deemo

Original gallery design and processing scripts by Mashiro:
https://github.com/mashirozx/deemo
The upstream history (86 commits through c0f999a) was squashed into a single
root snapshot; the Apache-2.0 license is retained.
The gallery, metadata, fetching tools, and documentation were adapted in 2026.

