does not change its ownership. Per-file attribution and source URLs are
recorded in data/sources/*.json and data/catalog.json.

src/vendor/legacy-ui.js is the upstream src/main.js, kept byte for byte. It
bundles third-party software under the MIT License, whose full texts are in
licenses/:
  html2canvas 0.5.0-beta3, Copyright (c) 2012 Niklas von Hertzen
    (licenses/html2canvas-MIT.txt; the bundle banner names 2016 and leaves
